## Title: Furnishing Catalog
## Author: clubwratt
## Version: 1.8.1
## AddOnVersion: 10000
## APIVersion: 101050 101051
## Description: Browse the game's furnishings by category and see each one in 3D as you scroll, the way a trader previews it. /furn opens the catalog; search by name from the box above the list; keep shopping lists, search a guild trader from them and show one list alone on the housing editor's Place tab; see which furnishings have a plan and read the plan's tooltip; link a furnishing or its plan in chat; look a furnishing up online. Gamepad UI.
## SavedVariables: FurnishingCatalogSavedVars
## ConsoleDependsOn: LibHarvensAddonSettings
## OptionalDependsOn: LibConsoleLogger JumpToSearch
## DevId: bc6b3b76-f701-4533-9492-c50acb1783bc
## ProdId: 8124da21-73b8-4387-a07f-9e01e44fc052

